WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.139
We have a voicemail number.

00:00:02.139 --> 00:00:04.920
That number is 2 1 9 2.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.920
David P..

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:09.030
Here is a voicemail about mail in voting.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:12.040
A very important topic this election cycle.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.040
Take a listen.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:21.289
We need to push the mail in vote regardless
of what he says in numbers.

00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:26.590
We need to push the mail vote.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:27.930
Absolutely agree.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.859
Listen, 20 20 could come down to mail in voting.

00:00:31.859 --> 00:00:36.200
We just don't know what the state of the pandemic
is going to be in November.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:44.690
If the numbers continue to decline between
now and then, we could have a safe ish situation

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.650
to go out and vote in person in November.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:51.240
But there are still going to be people that
will be scared and rightfully so, because

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:55.210
we are not going to eradicate this in any
significant way, maybe ever.

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:58.320
I mean, it might become just a seasonal thing
where you have to manage it with a seasonal

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.610
corona virus vaccine.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:00.610
We just don't know.

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:04.060
But it will still be here in some capacity
in November.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:10.140
If we are in the middle of a second wave in
November, then waiting on setting up vote

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:12.370
by mail is going to be too late.

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.330
There will be states who won't be able to
do it.

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:15.330
It'll be a disaster.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:17.560
So the caller could not be more right.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:21.460
We need to be pushing for vote by mail now.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:24.330
And fortunately, some states are doing it
now.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:28.690
Even places like Texas, at least for now,
are allowing anybody who wants an absentee

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.780
ballot to get an absentee ballot.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:36.200
And it's valid to say the reason I want one
is I'm afraid of getting corona virus that

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.050
is valid even in Texas right now.

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:44.320
But depending on the numbers, by November,
it may no longer apply to the November presidential

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:45.320
election.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:50.180
Understand that Trump has no federal authority
to ban vote by mail.

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:55.970
Trump also has no federal authority to designate
churches, essential organizations or whatever

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.270
the case may be.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.810
But that doesn't mean Trump isn't going to
run propaganda on this.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:02.460
He's already been pushing vote by mail leads
to voter fraud.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.460
It's not true.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:05.350
The data don't suggest that.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.450
Don't demonstrate it in any way whatsoever.

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:14.230
But we are starting to see local Republican
officials take a cue from Trump and start

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.530
to say it causes fraud.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:17.680
It opens the door to fraud.

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.610
Blah, blah, blah, blah, blah.

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:21.709
Let's not allow them to do that.

00:02:21.709 --> 00:02:25.810
Let's lobby all of our states to say, at minimum,
it doesn't.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.530
We're not saying right now.

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:29.080
Cancel in-person voting.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.670
We're just we don't need to do that.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:37.700
All we need is a rule that says if you want
to vote by mail, you can and you will not

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.209
have to justify it because you're out of state.

00:02:40.209 --> 00:02:41.209
You will not.

00:02:41.209 --> 00:02:43.530
You can just request an absentee ballot period.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:49.500
Better is we will send everyone an application
for an absentee ballot, which they have to

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.020
return to get an absentee ballot.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:55.530
Even better is we will send everyone an actual
absentee ballot.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:59.560
Now, different states have different rules
about what's allowed in terms of automatically

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:02.040
sending people absentee ballots versus, well,
you can't do that.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:03.850
You've got to send them an application.

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:04.850
Every state is different.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.790
It's a patchwork of 50 different elections.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:11.740
Let's go for the gold, which is send everybody
an absentee ballot and let them vote by mail.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:15.390
If not, send everybody an absentee ballot
application.

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:21.490
If not, let everybody request an absentee
ballot for any reason, even if it doesn't

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:27.740
meet the previously established requirements
for why one would get an absentee ballot.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.970
We can do this.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.670
And one last thing on this.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:34.180
I'm spending more time on this than I planned
to, but this is important.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.319
It only really matters in a few states.

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:37.319
Right.

00:03:37.319 --> 00:03:42.940
I mean, listen, California, whether they vote
